step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point and pick a banana if needed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy a Karamjan rum from Zambo at the pub for .</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use a knife on the banana, then use the <col=800000>sliced banana</col> on the rum. Unlike ordinary Karamjan rum, this can be taken through teleports.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point and pick a banana if needed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy a Karamjan rum from Zambo at the pub for .</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a knife on the banana, then use the sliced banana on the rum. Unlike ordinary Karamjan rum, this can be taken through teleports.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Buy <col=800000>jogre bones</col> from the <col=800000>Grand Exchange</col> or kill a <col=800000>jogre</col> at the location marked "Jogres" on the preparation map.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point and pick a banana if needed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy a Karamjan rum from Zambo at the pub for .</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a knife on the banana, then use the sliced banana on the rum. Unlike ordinary Karamjan rum, this can be taken through teleports.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy jogre bones from the Grand Exchange or kill a jogre at the location marked "Jogres" on the preparation map.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use a <col=800000>tinderbox</col> on the bones (requires 30 <col=800000>Firemaking</col>), then wait for the fire to go out and collect the <col=800000>burnt jogre bones</col>. Alternatively, use the bones on a <col=800000>furnace</col>.</col>
step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point and pick a banana if needed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy a Karamjan rum from Zambo at the pub for .</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a knife on the banana, then use the sliced banana on the rum. Unlike ordinary Karamjan rum, this can be taken through teleports.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy jogre bones from the Grand Exchange or kill a jogre at the location marked "Jogres" on the preparation map.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a tinderbox on the bones (requires 30 Firemaking), then wait for the fire to go out and collect the burnt jogre bones. Alternatively, use the bones on a furnace.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the fishing spots north of fairy ring CKR, south of Tai Bwo Wannai.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point and pick a banana if needed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy a Karamjan rum from Zambo at the pub for .</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a knife on the banana, then use the sliced banana on the rum. Unlike ordinary Karamjan rum, this can be taken through teleports.</str>
