line	<str>Use a tinderbox on the bones (requires 30 Firemaking), then wait for the fire to go out and collect the burnt jogre bones. Alternatively, use the bones on a furnace.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the fishing spots north of fairy ring CKR, south of Tai Bwo Wannai.</str>
line	
line	<str>Fish 45 raw karambwanji using a small fishing net. Keep the remaining karambwanji for the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a pestle and mortar on one raw karambwanji to make karambwanji paste.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the paste on the burnt jogre bones to make pasty jogre bones.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cook the pasty jogre bones to make marinated jogre bones. Do not bury the bones.</str>
line	
line	<str>Buy a raw karambwan from the Grand Exchange. Ironmen can complete these steps after helping Tiadeche.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cook it to make a poison karambwan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a pestle and mortar on the poison karambwan to make karambwan paste.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the paste on the spear required for the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Timfraku upstairs in the western hut north of Tai Bwo Wannai. Wait, then select .</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Lubufu at the fishing spots south of the Brimhaven house portal.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again to give him 20 raw karambwanji.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Wait, then accept his offer to learn how to fish karambwan and receive a karambwan vessel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Drop the vessel and ask Lubufu for another. Pick up the first vessel so that you have two.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Tiadeche, north-east of fairy ring DKP, and collect the nearby seaweed if needed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Tiadeche.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a raw karambwanji on a karambwan vessel, then use the baited vessel on Tiadeche.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Tamayu at the mine north-east of fairy ring CKR.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him twice and watch the cutscene.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use an agility potion(4) and your karambwan-poisoned spear on him. Make sure he takes both items.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again and watch him kill The Shaikahan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill a nearby monkey using Magic or Ranged and pick up its corpse.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the corpse on Tamayu to obtain monkey skin.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the seaweed on the skin to make a <col=800000>seaweed sandwich</col>.</col>
